Now impose the original full calibrated-domain local-minimum hypotheses:
\(\operatorname{rank}(G,H)=(7,6)\), \(0<t=F(G,H)<1/4\), and a spanning
kernel vector \(a\) of \(G\) supported exactly on \(S\), of occupancy
